<title>UK: Salomon sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc, New York said it has issued 200,000 range warrants on the Nikkei 225 average.</p>
<p> RANGE	     19,500-23,000	   PAYOUT	*0.1 CHF X D</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     18.20 CHF		 MAX PAYOUT   37.30 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	04.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	11.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	    *D IS NUMBER OF BUSINESS DAYS NIKKEI 225 AVERAGE</p>
<p>		     IN RANGE.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
